  "backstoryCard": {
    "backstoryNotes": "Male Avisari. Rovak, Hailing from the elite High-Crest lineage aboard the orbital shipyards of Skydock Alpha, Rovak was trained from a young age as a star-cartographer and FTL route analyst. While most of his flock preferred observing distant sector phenomena through long-range sensors, Rovak harbored a rare itch to experience outer space firsthand. Rovak left the safety of the High-Crest observatories. Now operating as a freelance long-range pilot and navigator. He hopes to one day be a captain of his own. He is a lean, light-built frame, with sleek plumage of broad lapis blue and silver accents along his wing-blades. A prominent ridge runs down his sharp beak, framing a pair of keen amber eyes. Running along his crown and neck is a crown of vibrant, iridescent gold and cobalt crest feathers."
  },
